#. column 8: Phase 10 cosmic tool.<br>Increases to <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>quality</ui-edge-color></ui-color> are 1.75 times higher than normal when material condition is <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Good</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br>Completing a stellar mission from start to finish with this tool equipped grants a bonus to earned rewards.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Lunar Credit Bonus:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> +35%<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Phaenna Credit Bonus:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> +10%
